      "body": "Declare DeepSeek V4.1's main KV, indexer K and compressor state TP-replicated so the existing CPU offloading sharing path activates. No cache-interface, planner or connector changes.\r\n\r\n8× H100, TP=8, 20 GiB GPU KV per rank and the same 64 GiB total CPU KV budget. Seeded replay of 3,072 requests across 407 LongBench v2 contexts, concurrency 8, chunks=1, up to 128 output tokens.\r\n\r\n| Metric | Stock offloading | Shared-host prototype |\r\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\r\n| Requests/s | 0.961 | 5.785 (**6.02×**) |\r\n| Output tokens/s | 25.60 | 146.09 (**5.71×**) |\r\n| p95 TTFT | 11.30 s | 0.95 s |\r\n\r\nTests: 93 focused checks passed on 1× NVIDIA H100 80GB. The three producer regressions fail on the base revision and pass with the fix. All applicable pre-commit hooks passed.\r\n",
